## Component Descriptions

| Component | Responsibility |
|-----------|----------------|
| **Client Layer** | UI rendering, user interactions, client state |
| **API Layer** | Auth validation, input validation, request routing |
| **Domain Layer** | Business logic, pricing, state machines, external integrations |
| **External Services** | Data persistence, auth, payments, logistics, AI |
| **Webhooks** | Asynchronous event processing (payment, delivery) |
| **Dashboards** | Role-specific UI (admin, seller, courier) |

