## Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Buyer
    participant App as Next.js App
    participant API as API Route
    participant DB as Supabase
    participant Xendit as Xendit
    participant Biteship as Biteship

    User->>App: Browse catalog
    App->>API: GET /api/products
    API->>DB: SELECT products (RLS: public)
    DB-->>API: Product list
    API-->>App: JSON
    App-->>User: Render products

    User->>App: Add to cart + checkout
    App->>API: POST /api/checkout/xendit
    API->>DB: SELECT product (stock check)
    DB-->>API: Product + stock
    API->>DB: RPC reserve_stock_for_order
    DB-->>API: reserved=true
    API->>Xendit: POST /v2/invoices
    Xendit-->>API: invoice_url
    API->>DB: INSERT order (payment=unpaid)
    DB-->>API: order_code
    API-->>App: { order_code, invoice_url }
    App-->>User: Payment page

    User->>Xendit: Pay via VA/E-wallet
    Xendit->>API: POST /api/webhooks/xendit
    API->>DB: UPDATE order (payment=paid, status=processing)
    API->>Biteship: POST /v1/shipments (if delivery)
    Biteship-->>API: shipment_code
    API->>DB: UPDATE order (shipment_code)
    API-->>Xendit: 200 OK
```

